Package: glados
Version: VERSION
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Fenriir42 <raid3r2205@gmail.com>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: libgmp10 (>= 2:6.0), libc6 (>= 2.17), zlib1g (>= 1:1.2.11)
Description: The Quant programming language toolchain
 Quant is a statically-typed, C-like scripting language with a stack-based
 bytecode VM, a full type checker, generics, structs, error handling, FFI,
 and a Language Server Protocol server for IDE integration.
 .
 Installed components:
  - glados      -- compiler, runner, and project manager (man glados)
  - quant-lsp   -- LSP server for editors (man quant-lsp)
  - glados-repl -- interactive REPL (man glados-repl)
  - quant-fmt   -- code formatter (man quant-fmt)
  - wheatley    -- static linter (man wheatley)
  - stdlib       -- standard library .qa files (13 modules, ~120 functions)
